# Cursor & AI Coding Rules - Exi Virtual Exhibition Backend

## Feature-First Engineering Standards
1. Follow domain-driven, modular architecture for all NestJS modules (`modules/<feature>/`).
2. Define schema & strong DTOs with `class-validator`, `class-transformer`, and Swagger `@ApiProperty()`.
3. Implement core business logic in services with Prisma ORM, handling data sanitization (e.g. `passwordHash`), soft deletes (`deletedAt: null`), and multi-tenant isolation.
4. Expose REST endpoints via controllers with clear OpenAPI annotations (`@ApiOperation()`, `@ApiResponse()`).
5. Verify changes with `npm run build` and Swagger UI (`/api/v1/docs`).

